# What ci-test writes, for .github's shared go.yml to send to Codecov.
/coverage/
# What go build writes for the package main at the root, as the wasip1 build of test-targets
# and "Go / targets" does.
/sim
# What release-files writes, for the shared release to sign.
/dist/
# The files of results of the decisive runs, kept between judgements: about 0.5 GB a rule, and the
# same seeds give them again to the byte (R28, R33 in docs/decisions.md).
runs/
